(text "Bank USB-C -> PD trigger, set to 5 V and button-locked.\nVerified to keep the B0DQPD24ZD bank awake on its own.\nNo fuse anywhere (see design review P1).\n1N5819 feeds the XIAO's 5V pin and blocks back-feed\nwhen the XIAO's own USB-C is plugged in for flashing." (at 15.24 78.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 95db90f0-4bbc-5185-8a58-d44e7e9dfdce))
